{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_LogoTitreStream.png?t=1744958530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tribute Games and Dotemu are teaming up again, in collaboration with Marvel Games, to craft an original, fresh beat 'em up. Featuring dynamic combat combos and dazzling pixel art, this planet-hopping adventure stands as a love letter to the Marvel Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_Titre_ENG_1.png?t=1744958530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So swears Annihilus, the living death that walks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After an unprecedented attack is launched across the galaxy, all life hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nova</strong>, <strong>Spider-Man</strong>, <strong>Wolverine</strong>, <strong>Phyla-Vell</strong>, <strong>Captain America</strong> and many more heroes, both earth-born and cosmic, will join forces in a star-spanning brawling adventure against the deadly Annihilation Wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From New York City to the depths of the Negative Zone, the future of the Universe will be fought for across the stars in <i>MARVEL Cosmic Invasion</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/1.gif?t=1744958530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_Titre_ENG_2.png?t=1744958530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re an old-school expert or a first-time fan, you\u2019ll find familiar faces and discover new favorites in a captivating roster of characters from across the Marvel Universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/2.gif?t=1744958530\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_Titre_ENG_3.png?t=1744958530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the <strong>Cosmic Swap tag-team system</strong>, choose two heroes for each level and switch between them instantly. Create unique combos and powerful special attacks. Each character\u2019s abilities encourage creative team-ups and a more tactical approach to the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/3.gif?t=1744958530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_Titre_ENG_4.png?t=1744958530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>MARVEL Cosmic Invasion</i> is a tribute to one of Marvel\u2019s most iconic eras, with stunning full-color pixel art designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/4.gif?t=1744958530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_Titre_ENG_5.png?t=1744958530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're teaming up with friends or family, <i>MARVEL Cosmic Invasion</i> has you covered with local/online play and a drop-in/drop-out adaptive system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cosmic battle awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/5.gif?t=1744958530\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2753970?t=1744958530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/41a34db6cd656d16fa0a261bcf749539886cbba9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744958530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/80dddb5e9ce0ff4919a2ba57b59aee09f194f917/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744958530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/80dddb5e9ce0ff4919a2ba57b59aee09f194f917/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744958530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_LogoTitreStream.png?t=1744958530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tribute Games and Dotemu are teaming up again, in collaboration with Marvel Games, to craft an original, fresh beat 'em up. Featuring dynamic combat combos and dazzling pixel art, this planet-hopping adventure stands as a love letter to the Marvel Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753970/extras/MCI_Titre_ENG_1.png?t=1744958530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So swears Anni